  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>“Just feel that burn, it’ll all be over soon.”</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Acid blast.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Add unraveling infusion to poison’s list of wild talents; it can be used with your poison blasts or any composite blasts which require poison. If you possess both fire and poison elements, your unraveling infusion receives a +2 bonus to its effective caster level. This bonus is doubled if you use it with a composite blast of both fire and poison elements.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/kineticist-feats#toc48\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
